# Feature Template

Reference: `packages/features/auth/` and `docs/FEATURE_GUIDE.md`

## Structure (Required)

Every shared feature package under `packages/features/<feature>/` must follow:

```
lib/src/
├── data/          → datasources, models, repositories, endpoints
├── domain/        → entities, repositories (abstract), usecases
├── presentation/  → bloc, pages, widgets (optional)
├── di/            → <Feature>DI.init()
├── routes/        → <Feature>Routes constants
└── module/        → <Feature>Module implements FeatureModule
```

## Naming

| Artifact | Pattern | Example |
|----------|---------|---------|
| Package | `snake_case` | `forgot_password` |
| BLoC | `<Feature>Bloc` | `AuthBloc` |
| UseCase | `<Verb><Feature>UseCase` | `AuthLoginUseCase` |
| Repository | `<Feature>Repository` / `Impl` | `AuthRepository` |
| DI | `<Feature>DI` | `AuthDI` |
| Module | `<Feature>Module` | `AuthModule` |
| Routes | `<Feature>Routes` | `AuthRoutes` |

## Layer Rules (Enforced by `melos validate:arch`)

| Layer | May import | Must NOT import |
|-------|-----------|-----------------|
| `domain/` | `core` | `data/`, `presentation/`, Flutter |
| `data/` | `domain/`, `network`, `storage`, `core` | `presentation/` |
| `presentation/` | `domain/`, `design_system`, `localization`, `core` | Dio, repo impls |
| `di/` | All layers | — |

## Public API

- Export via `lib/<feature>.dart` barrel only
- Never `import 'package:X/src/...'` from outside the package
- Hide `*_impl.dart` unless DI registration requires it

## App Features

`apps/*/lib/src/features/` = UI pages only. No BLoC, no repository, no use case.

## New Feature Workflow

```bash
# Always use melos run + -- separator
melos run feature:create -- <name> shared      # shared package
melos run feature:create -- <name> provider    # provider UI-only
melos run feature:create -- <name> client      # client UI-only
melos bootstrap
# Add <Feature>Module() to app module list — one line
```
